* Variables and Math *
x equals 5
y equals 10
result equals x plus y
type "Result of 5 plus 10:", result

* Percentage *
tip equals 15 percent of 200
type "15 percent of 200 is", tip

* Power *
squared equals 3 power 2
type "3 squared is", squared

* Control Flow *
if result more-than 10
    type "Result is big!"
what-if result equals 10
    type "Result is exactly 10!"
else
    type "Result is small."

* Lists *
scores equals list 10, 20, 30
type "Scores:", scores
type "Size of scores:", size of scores

type "First score:", position 1 in scores

insert 99 at position 2 in scores
type "After insert at position 2:", scores

remove position 3 from scores
type "After remove position 3 (which was 20):", scores

* Loops *
counter equals 0
repeat 3 times
    counter equals counter plus 1
    type "Loop count:", counter

repeat while counter less-than 5
    counter equals counter plus 1
    type "While loop count:", counter

* Inline List Test *
type "Here is an inline list:", list 1, 2, 3
